    "roles": ["band_member", "bandleader", "composer", "educator"],
    "summary": "A Mexico City drummer, classically trained, who came to Pat Metheny through Danilo Pérez and has played with the Pat Metheny Group since Speaking of Now (2002), with Gary Burton and Chick Corea, in his own Migration band and on the Birdman score. Metheny wrote The Gathering Sky for his left-foot clave: the clave on the hi-hat pedal with a bell under the heel, in 4/4, 5/4 or 7/8, and the hands soloing free over it."
